# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Leave empty or replace with your key in .env (never commit .env!)
#
# Quickstart — Free Zero-Billing Maps Demo Key (Prototyping):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing account or Cloud project required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Generate/reveal your Demo Key and copy it into .env as GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=<key>.
# Note: Maps Demo Key has daily reset limits and supports Maps JS API & Places API (New);
# for full Elevation API support and production usage, create a billed Google Cloud key
# restricted by HTTP referrer and enabled APIs:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
